# Optional. Raises the Hiro API read-only call rate limit well above the unauthenticated
# tier — get a free key at https://platform.hiro.so. Never a secret in the sense of guarding
# funds (this app never holds a private key), but still not meant to be committed as a real
# value — copy this file to .env.local and fill it in there.
VITE_HIRO_API_KEY=
